# RaktSetu needs no environment variables.
#
# The application is self-contained: accounts, requests, alerts, notifications,
# donation history, campus drives and moderation state all live in the
# visitor's own browser (see src/lib/local). There is no database URL, no API
# key, no service-role secret and nothing to configure — locally, on Netlify,
# or anywhere else.
#
# This file is kept only so a stale .env.local left over from an earlier
# Supabase-based build cannot confuse anyone; none of these names are read.
